}\\,⟹\\,\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{x}.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2})}{3x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{3}\\int \\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2})\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x}\\cdot  \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}\\int u\\cdot (\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}\\int u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{12}{u}^{2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{12}{ln}^{2}⁡({x}^{2})+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534450 true] [17592186288897 1000 #edb/ref 17592186288898 13194139534450 true] [17592186288897 1000 #edb/ref 17592186288899 13194139534450 true] [17592186288897 1000 #edb/ref 17592186288900 13194139534450 true] [17592186288897 1000 #edb/ref 17592186288901 13194139534450 true] [17592186288897 1000 #edb/ref 17592186288902 13194139534450 true] [17592186288897 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534450 true] [17592186288897 1041 "selection" 13194139534450 true] [17592186288897 1104 #edb/ref 17592186288898 13194139534450 true] [17592186288897 1110 #uuid "84906a4b-b873-5500-8bf5-b8c633338e14" 13194139534450 true] [17592186288898 1034 "\\frac{1}{12}{ln}^{2}⁡({x}^{2})+C" 13194139534450 true] [17592186288898 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534450 true] [17592186288898 1111 #uuid "190c27db-dd0f-559a-902b-5dbc83d859ee" 13194139534450 true] [17592186288899 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}{ln}^{2}⁡({x}^{2})+C" 13194139534450 true] [17592186288899 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534450 true] [17592186288899 1111 #uuid "e1ac7ac3-d198-554a-9743-ea0f4f9b7c34" 13194139534450 true] [17592186288900 1034 "\\frac{1}{12}\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2})+C" 13194139534450 true] [17592186288900 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534450 true] [17592186288900 1111 #uuid "c9f8db47-fddc-5cd3-b5b6-2928fd2958fb" 13194139534450 true] [17592186288901 1034 "\\frac{1}{12}{ln}^{2}⁡|x|+C" 13194139534450 true] [17592186288901 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 1319413953