[17592186288948 1113 #uuid "9fec3228-1358-581c-bfd2-8d4b419af6b7" 13194139534450 true] [17592186288948 1145 "Let $u={log}_{2}⁡x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}\\,⟹\\,\\operatorname{ln}⁡2\\cdot \\text{d}u=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{x}.\n$$\n\nCalculating the limits for $u$ gives the following:\n\n| $x$ | $4$ | $32$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $2$ | $5$ |\n\nWe now substitute and evaluate as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{4}^{32}\\frac{1}{x\\sqrt{{log}_{2}⁡x}}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{4}^{32}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{log}_{2}⁡x}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & ={\\int }_{2}^{5}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u}}\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡2\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡2{\\int }_{2}^{5}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡2\\cdot 2\\sqrt{u}\\,{|}_{2}^{5} \\\\  & =(2\\sqrt{5}-2\\sqrt{2})\\operatorname{ln}⁡2\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534450 true] [17592186288949 1000 #edb/ref 17592186288950 13194139534450 true] [17592186288949 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534450 true] [17592186288949 1041 "field-1" 13194139534450 true] [17592186288949 1104 #edb/ref 17592186288950 13194139534450 true] [17592186288949 1110 #uuid "e5a5ec03-5b0e-5ce0-ae81-bcd6e12d0f3e" 13194139534450 true] [17592186288950 1034 "2\\sqrt{5}-2\\sqrt{2}" 13194139534450 true] [17592186288950 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534450 true] [17592186288950 1111 #uuid "91355321-4aaa-5827-b25a-f768637dd369" 13194139534450 true] [17592186288951 1017 #edb/ref 17592186288952 13194139534450 true] [17592186288951 1089 "q-351283" 13194139534450 true] [17592186288951 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534450 true] [17592186288951 1100 "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{3}^{81}\\frac{2}{x\\sqrt{{log}_{3}⁡x}}\\,\\text{d}x=($\n{{field-1}}\n$)\\operatorname{ln}⁡3$" 13194139534450 true] [17592186288951 1113 #uuid "2b0fab75-92d3-57f7-aef2-4351e6b585ae" 13194139534450 true] [17592186288951 1